3. sorted normalized lines.
4. collect campaign ids; lockByIds? Preview shouldn't lock — "不写数据" — locking is a write-ish (SELECT FOR UPDATE takes locks but no data change). To keep preview truly read-only, use findById per campaign (no lock). I'll add a repo method findByIds? Simpler: loop findById. Fine.
5. All exist else 422.
6. Same tenant/window/audience else 422.
